### get all

GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses?page=0&size=3
### get by ids
GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses/6


### get by name
GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses/search?name=a&page3&size=2

### get students by course id

GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/students?page=0&size=2
### create

POST  http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Data Structures 3",
    "description": "Learn advanced data structures",
    "capacity":11,
    "active":true

}


###

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/courses/15
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Data Structures 3 Updated",
    "description": "Learn advanced data structures - Updated",
    "capacity":20,
    "active":true

}

### 
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/15


